      "clinical_diagnosis_basis": "Urine organic acid analysis by gas chromatography-mass spectrometry showed GHB, threo- and erythro-4,5-dihydroxyhexanoic acid (DHHA) and the DHHA lactones; sequencing of genomic DNA showed a homozygous missense mutation (c.667T>C; p.Cys223Arg) in exon 4, homozygosity confirmed by parental sequencing and SNP rs2744583",
